{"ticker":"EIX","updated":"2026-10-30T22:46:22Z","profile":{"longName":"Edison International","shortName":"Edison International","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.edison.com","fullTimeEmployees":13725,"marketCap":22623213568,"trailingPE":6.060825,"forwardPE":9.048834,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.164764,"pegRatio":2.64,"targetMeanPrice":62.9,"targetHighPrice":86.0,"targetLowPrice":42.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.041,"earningsGrowth":0.551,"grossMargins":0.61005,"operatingMargins":0.26899,"profitMargins":0.19281,"totalRevenue":19423000576,"beta":0.609,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":81.62,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":51.1,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":5.91},"summary":"Edison International, through its subsidiaries, engages in the generation and distribution of electric power. The company supplies and delivers through its electrical infrastructure to an approximately 50,000 square-mile area of southern, central, and coastal California. It serves residential, commercial, industrial, public authorities, agricultural, street lighting, and other sectors. The company's distribution network consists of approximately 13,000 circuit-miles of lines ranging from 55 kV to 500 kV and approximately 80 transmission substations; and approximately 38,000 circuit-miles of overhead lines, approximately 32,000 circuit-miles of underground lines, and approximately 730 distribution substations. Edison International was founded in 1886 and is based in Rosemead, California.","summary_zh":"愛迪生國際透過其子公司從事電力生產和配電業務。該公司透過其電力基礎設施向加州南部、中部和沿海地區約 50,000 平方英里的地區供電和輸送電力。它為住宅、商業、工業、公共機構、農業、街道照明和其他部門提供服務。該公司的配電網路由約 13,000 電路英里的 55 kV 至 500 kV 線路和約 80 個輸變電站組成；約 38,000 電路英里的架空線路、約 32,000 電路英里的地下線路以及約 730 個配電變電站。愛迪生國際公司成立於 1886 年，總部位於加州羅斯米德。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":55.51,"h":56.5,"l":54.9,"c":55.79,"v":